 2020 Q2","e":"zto","d":"2020-08-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sophie Li","x":"So to help them develop from an employee or may be a just a little entrepreneur to truly motivated to work for their own because they are able to achieve more market-driven as well as a fair pay that is passed through to them through the network partners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/zto-express-zto-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZTO 2020 Q2","e":"zto","d":"2020-08-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sophie Li","x":"We will gradually enhance the network structure through delayering and the streamlining, reducing the frequency of aggregation and sortation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/zto-express-zto-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZTO 2020 Q2","e":"zto","d":"2020-08-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sophie Li","x":"Given our scale today, it will not be difficult to obtain short term cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/zto-express-zto-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZTO 2020 Q2","e":"zto","d":"2020-08-13","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sophie Li","x":"We have raised our guidance for the full year parcel volume to reach between 16.2 billion to 17 billion, a goal we will endeavor wholeheartedly to achieve.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/zto-express-zto-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,5510,0,0,0,4779,433],[38,1,4568,0,0,0,3505,751],[39,1,3859,0,0,0,3020,598],[40,1,3839,0,0,0,2980,489],[41,1,3681,0,0,0,3034,309],[42,1,4471,0,0,0,3590,612],[43,1,5440,0,0,0,4344,863]],"cinema":[[36,1,5510,0,0,0,4779,433],[38,1,4568,0,0,0,3505,751],[39,1,3859,0,0,0,3020,598],[40,1,3839,0,0,0,2980,489],[41,1,3681,0,0,0,3034,309],[42,1,4471,0,0,0,3590,612],[43,1,5440,0,0,0,4344,863]],"imax":[[36,1,5510,0,0,0,4779,433],[38,1,4568,0,0,0,3505,751],[39,1,3859,0,0,0,3020,5